This is a verified 2-step route: (1) HWE olefination of the pyran-aldehyde with dimethyl(2-oxoethyl)phosphonate to give the enal, then (2) Wittig olefination with (carboxymethyl)triphenylphosphorane to install the conjugated diene-carboxylic acid. Both reaction steps were validated with `verify_step`, and the overall route passed `verify_route`.
